<aside class="my-6 rounded-lg border-2 border-amber-500 bg-amber-950/40 p-5 text-amber-100" aria-label="Administrator permissions">
  <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Plex sharing administrator access</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6">A GigaAdmin administrator can invite Plex users, grant or revoke library access, remove shares, and view private playback history and IP addresses.</p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6">Only add people you trust to administer your Plex server. These accounts are for administrators, not ordinary Plex viewers.</p>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6">Only super admins can invite or remove GigaAdmin administrators. The first account and accounts listed in ADMIN_USERS are super admins.</p>
</aside>
